  1226	row 22), so `where tar` / `where powershell` and the W-P2 assertions were never reachable to measure.
  1227	W-P2 was already unsatisfied at the last inventory — no `go.exe` on any PATH, no MSI/uninstall
  1228	registry entry, no tree at a conventional root — so `WIN_GOROOT` has **no known value today** and the
  1229	example above is a shape, not a fact. Both prerequisites are operator actions; the agent installs
  1230	nothing.
