  1731	### 6.4 `lint` — pin the linter version
  1732	
  1733	```yaml
  1734	      - uses: golangci/golangci-lint-action@v7     # major retained deliberately, §2.3
  1735	        with:
  1736	          version: v2.12.2       # was: latest
